verb wake_timer_clears "The head waits under the holes, faking out three times is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 150
  take timer_wake
  unless phase_wake

verb idle_timer_clears "The head turns to Link, face armored is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 290
  take timer_idle
  unless phase_idle

verb burrow_timer_clears "The head sinks back into the hole is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 430
  take timer_burrow
  unless phase_burrow

verb daze_timer_clears "The head is knocked out, still shaking off the blow is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 570
